  "elements": [
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_10a_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "For each primary study, we collected first author, year, country, study design, sample size, number of ERCP procedures, mean or median age, ERCP indications, procedure type, follow-up duration, adverse-event definitions or reporting windows, event numerators and denominators for PEP, bleeding, perforation, cholangitis or infection, severity classification, risk factors, and management strategies.",
