      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_13",
      "quote": "PEP : PEP was the most frequent and clinically significant complication associated with pediatric ERCP. In the present synthesis, 15 non-overlapping primary studies contributed extractable PEP event counts, yielding a pooled incidence of 7.3% (95% CI, 5.1% to 10.4%; I-squared = 83.7%) under a random-effects model.",
